%% Figure: Inventory hold lifecycle (event_inventory.inventory_holds.status).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE: POST /orders reserves seats or quantity
    ACTIVE --> CONFIRMED: payment captured (seats SOLD, sold_qty +n)
    ACTIVE --> RELEASED: payment declined or customer cancels
    ACTIVE --> EXPIRED: expires_at passed (3 min), swept on next order or payment
    ACTIVE --> RELEASED: payment arrives after expiry
    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    RELEASED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
